{
    "title": "Crazy Eights",
    "description": "Play Crazy Eights \u2013 The Ultimate Free Card Game and Multiplayer Experience!\r\n\r\nFrom the creators of classic card games like Solitaire and exciting multiplayer games like Monopoly Solitaire, we bring you our newest free card game \u2013 Crazy Eights! It's one of the best free games to enjoy with friends and family.\r\n\r\nRelive the thrill of card games with this fun game that combines the excitement of multiplayer games with strategic two player games. You can now play Crazy Eights with unique rules, various game modes, and an exciting leaderboard. Whether you\u2019re looking for a fun game or a challenging strategy card game, Crazy Eights is perfect for players of all skill levels. Play online games with friends or enjoy it as an offline game whenever you want!\r\n\r\nCrazy Eights \u2013 Free Card Games with Awesome Features:\r\n- Play card games by matching colors or numbers and be the first to discard all your cards to win in this two player game.\r\n- Compete in intense rounds to earn points and rise on the leaderboard in this dynamic free card game.\r\n- Enjoy multiplayer games with fast-paced card games strategy. Stack matching cards to increase your chances of winning in this two player game.\r\n- Experience a strategic twist on free card games by matching Draw 2 cards and pushing the draw up to +4 for your opponent \u2013 adding a fun element of strategy to this multiplayer game.\r\n\r\nGet the last laugh and victory by playing your LAST CARD in this exciting free card game!\r\n\r\nGame Features:\r\n- Play Crazy Eights \u2013 the classic card game reimagined with a groovy new theme.\r\n- Progress through wild leagues and climb to the top of the leaderboard. Can you master this fun strategy card game?\r\n- Enjoy strategic twists and fast-paced gameplay in one of the most engaging multiplayer games available.\r\n- Fun winning card animations add excitement to every victory.\r\n- Play offline games anytime for a quick and easy gaming session.\r\n\r\nSpecial Cards:\r\n- 8\u2019s are wild cards that can change the color in play.\r\n- Reverse Ace: flips the direction of the game.\r\n- +2: forces your opponent to draw 2 extra cards.\r\n- Skip Queen: skips the next player's turn.\r\n\r\nShow your competitive edge in this thrilling free card game. Whether you love multiplayer games, two player games, or relaxing offline games, Crazy Eights offers a variety of fun and strategy. Perfect for fans of free games, this fun game lets you challenge yourself and your friends at every level.\r\n\r\nPlay online games with friends or enjoy as one of the best offline games anytime. Download Crazy Eights now and become the champion of this exciting free card game!\r\n\r\nhttp://www.mobilityware.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Play Crazy Eights \u2013 The Ultimate Free Card Game and Multiplayer Experience!<br><br>From the creators of classic card games like Solitaire and exciting multiplayer games like Monopoly Solitaire, we bring you our newest free card game \u2013 Crazy Eights! It&#39;s one of the best free games to enjoy with friends and family.<br><br>Relive the thrill of card games with this fun game that combines the excitement of multiplayer games with strategic two player games. You can now play Crazy Eights with unique rules, various game modes, and an exciting leaderboard. Whether you\u2019re looking for a fun game or a challenging strategy card game, Crazy Eights is perfect for players of all skill levels. Play online games with friends or enjoy it as an offline game whenever you want!<br><br>Crazy Eights \u2013 Free Card Games with Awesome Features:<br>- Play card games by matching colors or numbers and be the first to discard all your cards to win in this two player game.<br>- Compete in intense rounds to earn points and rise on the leaderboard in this dynamic free card game.<br>- Enjoy multiplayer games with fast-paced card games strategy. Stack matching cards to increase your chances of winning in this two player game.<br>- Experience a strategic twist on free card games by matching Draw 2 cards and pushing the draw up to +4 for your opponent \u2013 adding a fun element of strategy to this multiplayer game.<br><br>Get the last laugh and victory by playing your LAST CARD in this exciting free card game!<br><br>Game Features:<br>- Play Crazy Eights \u2013 the classic card game reimagined with a groovy new theme.<br>- Progress through wild leagues and climb to the top of the leaderboard. Can you master this fun strategy card game?<br>- Enjoy strategic twists and fast-paced gameplay in one of the most engaging multiplayer games available.<br>- Fun winning card animations add excitement to every victory.<br>- Play offline games anytime for a quick and easy gaming session.<br><br>Special Cards:<br>- 8\u2019s are wild cards that can change the color in play.<br>- Reverse Ace: flips the direction of the game.<br>- +2: forces your opponent to draw 2 extra cards.<br>- Skip Queen: skips the next player&#39;s turn.<br><br>Show your competitive edge in this thrilling free card game. Whether you love multiplayer games, two player games, or relaxing offline games, Crazy Eights offers a variety of fun and strategy. Perfect for fans of free games, this fun game lets you challenge yourself and your friends at every level.<br><br>Play online games with friends or enjoy as one of the best offline games anytime. Download Crazy Eights now and become the champion of this exciting free card game!<br><br>http://www.mobilityware.com",
